  "definition": "Facility-Based In-Service Training as Related to the Practice of Occupational Therapy",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-07-26",
  "historyNote": "#8896, eff 6-7-07; ss by #10902, eff 7-29-15; ss by #13417, eff 7-26-22 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Occ 400)",
